names
  params   map  Parameters of the workflow, with their declared type
  vars     map  All variables of the run as text: parameters, project, environment
  env      map  Environment variables of the operating system
  run      map  The current run
  result   map  Result of the action the link starts from (in link conditions)
  results  map  Results of the actions that have run, by action id
  row      any  The current entry of forEach; only in actions with forEach
  request  map  The request of the caller of an http trigger; nil if the run was not started by one
functions / Date
  today()                    date     Today, 00:00 local time
  now()                      date     The current date and time
  formatDate(date, pattern)  string   Writes a date as text. Pattern letters: yyyy year, MM month, dd day, HH:mm:ss time, EEE weekday, MMMM month name, 'text' in quotes
  parseDate(text, pattern)   date     Reads a date from text with a pattern like formatDate
  addDays(date, n)           date     Adds days; negative numbers go back
  addHours(date, n)          date     Adds hours
  addMonths(date, n)         date     Adds months
  dayOfWeek(date)            integer  Weekday: 1 Monday … 7 Sunday
  diffDays(from, to)         integer  Days from one date to another
functions / Text
  upper(text)                       string  Text in capital letters
  lower(text)                       string  Text in small letters
  trim(text)                        string  Removes spaces at the start and end
  replace(text, old, new)           string  Replaces all occurrences
  replaceRegex(text, pattern, new)  string  Replaces every match of a regular expression (write patterns with \ in backticks, e.g. `\d+`); new may use groups as $1 or ${name}, $$ for a $
  split(text, separator)            list    Splits text into a list
  padLeft(text, length, fill)       string  Fills on the left up to a length, e.g. 007; fill defaults to a space
  padRight(text, length, fill)      string  Fills on the right up to a length
  substr(text, start, length)       string  Part of a text, counting from 0; length is optional
  left(text, n)                     string  The first n characters
  right(text, n)                    string  The last n characters
  concat(separator, a, b, …)        string  Joins values with a separator and leaves out empty ones, so no separator stands alone; lists count with their entries
  normalize(text)                   string  Replaces umlauts and ß, joins spaces – e.g. for file names
functions / Paths
  basename(path)  string  Last part of a path or address, e.g. the file name; / and \ both separate
  dirname(path)   string  The path without its last part, e.g. the folder of a file; empty without a folder
  ext(path)       string  Ending of the file name with its dot, e.g. .zip; empty without one
functions / Numbers and lists
  len(value)               integer  Number of characters, entries of a list or keys of a map
  round(number)            number   Rounds to a whole number
  sum(list)                number   Sum of a list of numbers
  map(list, .field)        list     Takes a field of each entry, e.g. the sizes of files
  filter(list, condition)  list     Keeps the entries for which the condition is true
  join(list, separator)    string   Joins a list of texts
functions / Empty values
  coalesce(a, b, …)  any   The first value that is not empty
  isEmpty(value)     bool  Whether a value is empty: nothing, empty text, list or map
